  "id": "psychache",
  "term": "psychache",
  "definition": "Psychache is intense mental or psychological pain, such as deep hurt, anguish, or inner aching. In suicide research, it is considered a key factor linked to suicidal thoughts, especially when the person experiences this pain as unbearable.",
